# Secrets & local config
#
# `.env.*` with `.env.example` exempted, rather than the two exact names this
# used to list. `.env` and `.env.local` were covered; `.env.production`,
# `.env.staging` and a hand-made `.env.bak-<date>` were not — and a backup of a
# populated .env is the same secrets under a name nothing was watching.
# `.env.example` is the one that must stay tracked: `nem parity` reads it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

